# NOITE's prison escape (3farmcai) starts the real SERIAL, which wins: NOITE
# gets 0x40c (hides), then 0x40a, shows itself, adds the score and goes
# back to the prison (the jail fight, XILINDRO's minigameWon[3], is not won
# here; with it the win goes to the hall).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 3farmcai --ms 126000 --input tools/play/serial-3farmcai-win.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 3farmcai --ms 126000 --fix all --input tools/play/serial-3farmcai-win.input
#
# The escape video ends at 1710 (MM_MCINOTIFY: the WinExec); SERIAL starts
# 1500 ms later (its WM_CREATE at 3210 seeds the figures). The shots are
# `tools/serial_plan.py --start 3210 --win`. The two versions play
# different games (BUGS.md K5); each shot hits a killer in at least one of
# them, and in the other a killer, another figure or nothing (the score of
# a win does not count). Both have lives left when the clock ends SERIAL at
# 123210: the Original 2, a win of MAKELONG(2, 500) = 32768002 that NOITE
# adds whole (BUGS.md K1, K2; on screen B19 shows the low word); the
# Corrigida 1, a win of 500.
